# Migration assessment: `Scaleway`

- Source: `aws`
- Catalog: `Scaleway` snapshot from `https://www.scaleway.com/en/pricing/`, retrieved 2026-11-01

## Summary

| Fit | Resources |
|---|---|
| direct | 3 |
| partial | 1 |
| none | 2 |
